      "text": "Sen. Martha McSally supported a plan to turn Medicare into a voucher program and ‘shift costs’ onto seniors.",
      "sourceText": "Sen. Martha McSally “supported a plan to turn Medicare into a voucher program and ‘shift costs’ onto seniors” and “even supported raising the retirement age.",
